Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|plugins.deployment.type|osgi|
		|testray.main.component.name|Message Boards|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG

Scenario: MB Subscription Manager Portlet Smoke
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|portlet.plugins.includes|mb-subscription-manager-portlet|
	When these variables
		|appName|Message Boards Subscription Manager|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Message Boards Subscription Manager|
	Then AntCommand ant Command the value 'remove-plugin -Dplugin.name=my-subscriptions-portlet' at locator 'build-test.xml'